    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruac go̱o̱kä mi jiääk kɛ kui̱ Dhor",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ cäŋ in jio̱liɛn kä paykɛ wäl kɛl runi mëë ta̱kɔ pɛɛcä, cu ruac Kuɔth Nhial ben kä ɣä wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gat ran, ruacni kɛ kui̱ Dhor ëë ruac kɛ kui̱ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial mɛmɛ lar wëë i̱, “Ɣän bä ram mi gak kɛ Dhor nööŋ kui̱c caam ala Kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn ni Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar, min la kuäär kua̱ri. Bɛ ben kɛɛl kɛ jiöŋköörikɛ kɛnɛ thurbiɛɛlikɛ kɛ nɛy ti ci kɔt kɛ jiöŋkööri, kɛ rɛm mi di̱i̱t.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mɛmɛ ɛ min lar Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial ɛ kɛ kui̱ Dhor wëë i̱, “/Cɛ nɛy tin cieŋ jɔk yieer bi lath, mi wä ji̱ buɔ̱ɔ̱tni wä daar, mi wa naath wä näk rɛydu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi ruëëc jɔak yiëër diaal ben piny kuäärädiɛn kä bikɛ bieynikiɛn tin tekɛ biɛɛl woc pua̱nynikiɛn. Kä bɛ kɛ kum kɛ dual, kä bikɛ nyuur piny lathɛ kɛ gua̱thni diaal, kä bɛ kɛ gäy kɛ ji̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bikɛ ji̱ par kɛ diit jiɛthä lɔaac, bikɛ ji̱ jiök i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mɛmɛ ɛ min laar Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial wëë i̱, “Mi wa̱a̱ ji̱ jakä wec mi te lɔrä, ce̱tkɛ wi̱i̱ tin /ca ciɛŋ ɛ naath. Ɣän bä pi̱w bäpdiit jakä bä kä yɛ, pi̱w kɛ tin ŋuan ba yɛ buɔny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ɛn wa̱nɔ ɣän bä ji̱ naŋ piny kɛɛl kɛ nɛy tëë ci li̱w, nɛy tëë ci li̱w ni wal. Ɣän bä ji̱ jakä cieŋ piny muɔ̱ɔ̱n rɛy nɛɛni tëë ci dhiap ni wal. /Ci rɔ bi nyɔk kɛ luny raar, kä bia cu thil gua̱a̱th muun nɛɛni tin tëk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän bä yɛ moc kɛ guut dualä mi bɛc, bia cu thuɔ̱k. Bi naath yɛ go̱r, kä /cikɛ yɛ bi nyɔk kɛ jek, ruac ni ɣän Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
